 - Update the empty state message to reflect when filters are active

3. Enhanced the UI to:
 - Display location information in the worldwide member list items
 - Provide visual feedback for selected categories
 - Use an expandable dropdown for categories to save space

This implementation allows users to:
1. Quickly search across chapter members as before
2. Perform more targeted searches on the worldwide directory using category and location filters
3. See relevant location information for worldwide members
4. Easily reset filters without affecting the main search bar

